1621
01:39:29,416 --> 01:39:31,875
I don't know anything, sir.

1622
01:39:33,125 --> 01:39:34,583
I didn't do anything to them, sir.

1623
01:39:34,625 --> 01:39:36,791
I swear I don't know where they are, sir.

1624
01:39:37,083 --> 01:39:39,041
